   "source": [
    "# Tutorial 01 â€” The Data Model & the Math of LCA\n",
    "\n",
    "Companion explainer: **01_ecosystem_and_lca_math.md**. We compute a tiny\n",
    "3-process system **by hand with NumPy**, then build the *same* system in\n",
    "Brightway and show the score matches to machine precision. This trust-but-\n",
    "verify pattern is the backbone of every model you'll build."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "5c67803c",
